WEBVTT

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.080
Big...

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.080
Brother...

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:03.510
<i>Take a look at this. This is an unexpected video
shot by a Japanese filming team...</i>

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:09.310
LARGE FIRE AT BAYRON AIRPORT. WHAT HAPPENED?

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:09.310
BREAKING
NEWS

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:09.310
<i>flying near Bayron City to investigate
the underwater earthquake.</i>

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.400
<i>Bayron City Airport is engulfed in flames.</i>

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.150
<i>And take a look at the other video.</i>

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:19.240
<i>Can you tell there is a mysterious
flying object in this footage?</i>

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:22.830
<i>The enemy attack made a direct hit
on the airport runway.</i>

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:25.620
<i>However, thankfully, every flight
has been canceled for the past few days,</i>

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.290
<i>so there have been no injuries
or casualties reported as of yet.</i>

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:32.170
Have everyone left in the airport
immediately take shelter!

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:35.460
Also, give an evacuation notice
to all residents within a five-kilometer radius!

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.130
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.220
Awakening at the crack of dawn...

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.350
What an early riser.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:50.690
EPISODE 12
BELIEVE IN HIM

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:50.690
You have work, AAA.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:55.440
That said, the firm's president
is currently incarcerated.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:03:01.240
So, unless the director general who imprisoned me
here directly bows his head down to me,

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.910
I have no intent to take on
any jobs from the police.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:09.120
When you make things difficult like that,
the only one who ultimately gets in trouble is me.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.210
What happened to the other companies?

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.840
Don't they work directly for that boy now?

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:21.220
I've been contacting them this whole time,
but none of them are responding as of last night.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.890
I see.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:27.720
To the point where they think it's too strong,
this battle is a hopeless one.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:33.810
This is likely the first and last
S-Class demon we'll face.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.860
Um...

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:39.610
Today, at 5:54 AM,

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:44.820
there was a large fire
at Bayron City Airport.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.610
REPORT ON THE INVESTIGATION
OF THE CAUSE OF THE LARGE FIRE
AT BAYRON CITY AIRPORT AT 5:54 AM

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:44.820
An attack from an unidentified creature.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:50.870
We couldn't keep that part hidden
because overseas media got footage.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.000
But you're still going to say we're ignorant

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.250
and completely lack knowledge
about the identity of that thing.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.630
I'll let you handle all the domestic
and international media.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.470
Do your best to keep feigning
ignorance to the end.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:02.630
What about you, Sis Shen?

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.590
I have a summit meeting in an hour...

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.560
with Mr. Mayor in tow.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.930
Whether or not we can preserve
the autonomy of the City...

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.940
this will be a crucial moment.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.940
We're not going to give up on this city.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:22.070
We're not going to abandon it,
let alone hand it over to some other country.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:26.530
In order for the City to be
a paradise of freedom and immorality,

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:27.240
huh?

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:31.410
Those who are going to flee
because demons are here can be left alone.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.330
The people suitable for this city...

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:37.540
are those who can prioritize
their greed over their own lives.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.250
Just like us...

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.260
They're all back.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:47.140
That girl I banged just once
when I was drunk

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:51.020
and how I paid for that hotel
with Ayano's credit card...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.310
Every single memory
that I supposedly sacrificed to you...

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.770
H-Huh?

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:59.770
That's not all. There are a few memories
mixed in that aren't even mine.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.440
Were these memories yours, Kisara?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.950
"Kisara"?

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:12.660
Is that my name?

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:22.550
That's what that cute Kanna has become?

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:26.340
I really have a sense
of just how long 12 years is.

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:30.510
I don't think that's the kind of growth
you feel nostalgic about.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:36.140
<i>Airport Island and all residents within a five-kilometer
radius from it have all been evacuated.</i>

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.440
<i>You can fight to your heart's content.</i>

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.360
Let me tell you this...
I'm not going to kill her!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.190
I've even changed her diapers in the past!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.530
<i>The priority of that half-demon half-human
staying alive is at rock bottom.</i>

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.780
<i>If you think you can promise that to the end,
you can go ahead and try.</i>

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:58.250
So, I have to end this battle
with everyone still alive, huh?

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.970
You're such an idiot.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.180
I am? Why?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:16.850
Why did you return all the memories you took
from me when you canceled the contract?

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.100
Huh?

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.400
No.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:25.610
In the first place, what you converted
into power weren't my memories.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.370
They were your own memories...

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:40.420
from before you met me.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:48.300
You thought I'd be happy
if you did something like this?

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:55.260
You thought I'd feel relieved when you lost
all your memories you made with me?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.060
Idiot. You're an idiot.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.150
You are an idiot.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.820
Am I an idiot?

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:10.650
Yeah, no doubt. I mean...

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.120
U-U-Um—

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:19.540
Because now, I know everything,
including how you feel.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.540
Um, I...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.000
Right. You don't know.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:30.590
Because you returned
every single memory to me.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:32.510
And that wasn't just
all the memories you took from me...

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:36.010
but your own memories you had, as well.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.770
Is that... so?

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.850
How you interpreted
the contract cancellation is absurd.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.980
What are you doing,
giving the human a clear profit?

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.730
You're a demon.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.240
Is that strange?

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.530
Yeah.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.860
It's way too strange.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:55.950
That's why...

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.460
I can't lend an ear to your plea.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.380
I can't possibly flee from this city.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.800
This time, I'll be the one
who'll protect you.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.800
That's our new contract.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.010
U-Um...

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.390
Um...

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.860
Stay hidden in a safe spot.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.050
Can it be that you came as backup?

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:55.430
The opposite.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.430
I came here to bid farewell.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.510
I see.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:05.020
A Celestial Abbey battleship will reach
these seas in about three hours.

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:08.400
The next time we meet,
we'll be enemies.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:10.860
I won't let you kill Kanna, okay?

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.320
We're talking about the Abbey here.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:16.030
They won't hesitate to sink the demon,
Mega-Float and all.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.240
Then, we might shoot you down first.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.870
All for Shu, huh?

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:24.330
That's not everything but is a part of it.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:28.210
I pity your subordinates
who have to deal with your personal whims.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.210
They have no choice.
That's just who I am.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.720
I have to simply reward them
with good pay and good benefits.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.260
But since you're someone
from the Abbey,

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:41.680
I won't deny you fighting
according to your doctrines.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.560
As we both were sent on wild goose chases
from the same guy...

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.940
I'd have liked to be friends.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.860
You still believe in him.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.900
You're fundamentally different from me.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.790
Because he never...

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.830
let me believe in him.

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:15.760
I'm here to deliver the item you ordered!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.380
Thanks for your hard work!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:20.140
You really are fast all the time!

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:26.020
We set it to the speed you desired,

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.940
but because of that,
the running time is only about five minutes.

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.560
More than enough.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:35.610
And the payment for this delivery
was to be billed to the Bayron City Police, right?

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.610
No.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:40.360
Bill the Police Agency Director General's
personal account.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.830
Target is in firing range!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.830
All right. Commence fire!

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.050
That thing...

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.390
<i>Target is not showing any signs of retaliation!</i>

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.270
<i>But it doesn't look
like the attack is working, either!</i>

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:17.110
Continue the attack. Push her back
so that she doesn't set foot in the City!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.070
Roger that!

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:27.200
She's just like a clam.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:30.290
She's just going to turtle up and defend?

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.960
What is she thinking?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.210
Ayano, what's going on?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:37.090
<i>Is she really antagonizing humans?</i>

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.630
She almost killed Kisara last night!

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:43.970
<i>Perhaps, she went after Kisara
because she was a demon.</i>

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.720
It's hopeless to bet
on a possibility like that though!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.410
It has begun!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.460
What destructive power!

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.880
It is like a giant military weapon!

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:21.590
How much can Bayron City hold back
without having an army?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.590
Maybe this will be the end for the City.

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:28.010
I guess I should think
about what to do in the future.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:31.020
Was it really a good thing
not to take on this job?

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.310
Why are you saying that now
after all's said and done?

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:37.730
You even worked out a means to escape
with our company's helicopter.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.450
<i>Ayano, what's the meaning of this?</i>

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.450
Did you do something to Kanna?

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.370
I'd like to know myself!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.110
Shu?

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.490
Sorry I'm late.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.580
Reload all the weapons
and ammo right now.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:37.210
We'll have one more battle.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.540
Shu... Your memories?

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:41.800
Ayano...

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:43.840
That wasn't cool.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:44.550
Huh?

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:48.890
You seduced me so that Kisara
would take those memories from me.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.310
She really held a grudge about that.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:53.310
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wha...

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.770
She even told you about that?

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.690
Yeah, she told me.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:04.360
She didn't just give me back my memories
but even gave me all of hers.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.400
What about Kisara?

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:11.410
She's not friend or foe anymore.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.910
She's an ignorant girl we need to protect.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.870
You're way too soft on her.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.460
What a terrible girl.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.500
For you to be saying that, Ayano—

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.960
And it's against the rules
for you to say anything about it!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:25.920
Ow!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.470
But if Kisara's not here,
how will you fight?

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.890
You don't want to kill Kanna,

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:34.720
but we can't let her set foot in the city.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.980
We'll lure Kanna into this Plant.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:40.980
That way, we can minimize
the damage done to civilians.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.440
But how will we lure her over?

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:46.490
Kanna will most definitely come here.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:50.950
I fled at a high altitude on purpose
so that she would catch a glimpse of me.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.370
Is she coming here after you, Shu?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.160
Oh, um, well—

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.080
Impossible!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.290
You only have each other as siblings! Why?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.960
Don't get it wrong.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:09.220
The demon isn't coming after him.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.640
It's after you, Ayano.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:12.680
Huh?

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:17.310
The second bug that pesters
her beloved big brother.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.560
Jealousy?

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.900
It was left behind in Kisara's memories.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:26.940
What Kanna had been watching
for the past 12 years...

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:24.610
ALARM

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.780
She'd been connected with Shu
through dreams?

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:36.330
The little sister saw it all in a hell where
she couldn't move or have a conversation.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:40.120
Her beloved brother, the only survivor,

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:45.210
kept around by some mysterious older woman
and falling into the life of a freeloader...

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:49.800
What she saw was some mysterious nun
going after his body and his life!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:55.300
Kanna has emotionally stopped
at the age of three.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:59.230
She didn't learn how to control emotions,
so she didn't grow up to be reasonable.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:02.850
She's simply a child
who has the strongest powers out there!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:08.030
And to add to that, she's been emotionally warped
as she kept watching her degenerate big brother

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:10.030
go from one woman to another.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:13.740
She didn't stop emotional growth!
It's been growing in a terrible way!

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.140
They're at fault!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:40.350
We were struggling
just to defeat all those extra ones.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:41.850
Dammit!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.520
Can we really not do anything about this?

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.860
Didn't we decide for ourselves
that we won't do anything?

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.320
Don't go full power right here.

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:56.450
The helicopter is ready.
We can depart now, okay?

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:04.080
So, why did you come back here, Sharon?

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:07.040
He apologized...

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.000
that he'd forgotten about me.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.960
Is that all it took to forgive him?

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:15.050
This guy let a demon eat the memories
of spending time with you.

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.300
That isn't everything...

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:20.510
but that's one aspect of it.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.770
You're the third bug!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:30.980
It's about one more hour
before the Abbey's battleship arrives.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:34.700
In other words, we have to finish
everything in that time.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.910
If you don't want this city to fall to ruin.

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:41.910
<i>Target has entered the Plant.</i>

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:45.580
<i>Confirmed the evacuation of all employees
and the suspension of electrical power.</i>

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.460
Roger that. Resuming attack—

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.920
No, please hold on!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.010
Do you remember?

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.930
You do remember, right?

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.640
Kanna.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.690
It's reacting to Mr. Ogata's calls to it?

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:10.230
So, it really has Kanna's will left inside.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.690
That means there is room
for negotiation.

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:16.070
Just like Miss Kisara,
if she can side with us—

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.700
But will it go that easily?

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:22.910
Right now, she's just like a three-year-old child
who has the nuclear switch.

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:25.450
I've been looking for all this time...

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.960
In order to save you,
I even borrowed the powers of a demon.

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:33.550
I thought I could throw
everything away for your sake.

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:35.380
But now,

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.840
though just a little bit,
I have a different feeling.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:40.970
Kanna...

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.350
I will take you back.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.850
We will live together again in this city.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.520
But to do that,
I won't throw anything away.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.110
I won't lose anything else anymore.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:57.740
Neither you nor all the people
dear to me nor this city.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.030
It's all right. We can do this.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:05.040
You're aware of this, right?

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.080
I'm likely the only human in this world...

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.380
who lives together with a demon!

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:17.800
So, I'm sorry, Kanna.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.970
I'll be sealing you away again.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.860
Now, Shu!

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:52.000
You're not getting away!

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:07.780
Kanna!

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:32.100
Shu!

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:24.990
BELIEVE IN HIM
AND FIGHT TOGETHER

00:23:55.580 --> 00:24:00.000
EPISODE 13
UNRESOLVED GRAND FINALE

00:23:56.580 --> 00:23:58.910
"Unresolved Grand Finale."
